            <div xml:id="d341">

                <pb facs="0459" n="371" xml:id="pg371"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">724.3415/3422: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Bolivia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Des Fortes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Acting Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">La
                                Paz</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-06T16:00:00-04:00">December 6, 1933—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:28 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>94. The League Commission arrived in La Paz last night and was warmly
                    welcomed.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Des Portes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
